data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":80,"item_id":"rs_0a1df9340045f91d016acb0cc0341c8195a53069fbf427e42d","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering position implementation**\n\nI'm thinking about implementing a position column that's initialized with an ID. It seems like I should append the maximum position for project creation and moving items around. A single update subquery focusing on max atomicity should be sufficient, and I want to make sure there's no waiting period between validation and updating. I need to double-check that my approach aligns with best practices for efficiency and performance!"}

